    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好恰鬼系列又来了！继上次介绍完江西米粉（</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66114f9c4f66d1c1da58136f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66114f9c4f66d1c1da58136f"><span>点击跳转</span></a><span>）之后，义乌特产——江西小炒又成功吸引了我们的注意。这期就来聊一聊江西小炒。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> 以义乌特产出圈的江西小炒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> 江西小炒到底是什么炒什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 江西人眼中的小炒菜，简单说就是：有味！下饭！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a> 来一段报菜名儿：辣椒炒辣椒、酒糟空心菜梗、白菜梗炒肉、啤酒鸭、红烧小甲鱼、红烧黄丫头……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1735">28:55</a> 地缘优势、口味优势、价格优势让江西小炒占领江浙沪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2078">34:38</a> 江西小炒说到底还是家乡的味道</span></p>]]></description>
