    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>民国奇案之一刺杀孙传芳的凶手施剑翘的传奇故事，被很多艺术家关注并喜爱，随意检索以施剑翘为原型的文艺作品如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1988年电影《女刺客》</span></p><span></span><p><span>2013电影《一代宗师》</span></p><span></span><p><span>2018电影《邪不压正》</span></p><span></span><p><span>2018话剧《特赦》</span></p><span></span><p><span>站在打工人的角度，施剑翘实乃公关高手，最成功的案例就是她自己！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoH-6P3RK8rko-A2A51fkwGyQ-ug.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjOFg7wH2XdpCQWMBsSpV_70BOre.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhq9DzEF3YrmDYtRfxKZ2ymTRAn_.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxnYRLbFW1PRdWenxIwPhVa-hER.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrcVGCv0kMwJqHau4LnEw4Rgikf7.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
