  <item>
    <title>vol.49 《长安的荔枝》教你社畜的正确姿势</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6608c6cb1519139e4f9eb8ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6608c6cb1519139e4f9eb8ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Mar 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>职场久了，难免会碰到棘手的任务，棘手到极限时可能有两个后果：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1，实现了原本不可能完成的任务；</span></p><span></span><p><span>2，突破了本我的边界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《长安的荔枝》讲的就是这么一个故事，唐代的基层公务员如何在当时的保鲜技术和运输设备条件下实现五千里闪送新鲜荔枝的创举。</span></p><span></span><p><span>技术层面，他充分运用了实验出真知，</span></p><span></span><p><span>通过三次真人实验，突破当下保鲜技术的极限，实现了11天的荔枝保鲜期。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhBKVWCGqHUEBZBlLNOTGE3HA9yv.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>在四条山路蜿蜒水路曲折的路线中，找出最优路线。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi9AmTNKMjYY-YOwlrVnP8fuYiz2.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>在政治层面，他充分调动了荔枝农户/胡商/宰相的积极性，实现了这一创举！并歇斯底里挑战了最高权力！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎走进这一期打工人系列，职场虐文，看见正在被虐的自己！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmWXjmyoPyAUhx2tn7lNTqtmv_5A.m4a" length="46237872" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzYjhRanZsWHBkOTZtem1MRHV6VllIY1VWRUMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.47 饭“局”王是怎么样炼成的？实践出真知</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65edb08c8e6f71a5b7235b84</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65edb08c8e6f71a5b7235b84</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Mar 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期立志今年要成为“销冠”小朱申请的一堂私教培训课：饭局到底要怎么吃？</span></p><span></span><p><span>为此，特地请来了两位嘉宾：王同学、郑老师，来分享他们的实战经验。小朱表示，请三个月组个“局”来检验她的学习成果。</span></p><span></span><p><span>话不多说，上菜！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> 饭局的尴尬=想象中长袖善舞的你VS实际饭局I人的你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> I人想融入饭局，先观察，找好同盟阵营</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a> 饭局一般分为三个阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="701">11:41</a> 郑老师的饭局方法论，现学现卖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a> 王同学的攒局成功案例，硬功夫不行，咱先把菜点好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> 河南饭局的祝酒词那是一套套的，主陪副陪三四陪，让你还没等热菜上齐，就歇菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2037">33:57</a> .搞砸了的局你遇到过几个</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2426">40:26</a> “局”怎么样不重要，重要的是你在局中的表现如何，勇敢做自己！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2548">42:28</a> 女性同胞们，下半场是你的主场</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lljiBs_AJ6zpBWgQsyhcwuV24v-g.m4a" length="44135114" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvWSXzevssR8bBK_xSK-couviY4a.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol 46.上官婉儿：体制内端水魅力</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e4122019c3a0760c20d59b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e4122019c3a0760c20d59b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Mar 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>武周时代激发了很多女性的权力欲望：韦后想要效仿她从辅佐丈夫到取代丈夫，太平公主觉醒后企图争取继承之位，连最不可能成功的罪臣之后上官婉儿都拼搏到巾帼宰相之位。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但上官婉儿在唐朝职业路径也完整演绎了女性在职场会遇到的一切困境：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a> 13岁因为学习成绩好，成为老板娘贴身秘书，但晋升只能体现为嫔妃官阶；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> 33岁老板娘自立门户，自己也升职加薪，看似光鲜亮丽的职业路径背后，是她不仅要讨好老板儿子女儿和侄子，连远方亲戚一个周旋不周，都险些被杀。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> &nbsp;47岁位同宰相，修炼一生的端水技能，却还是折在大老板孙子的手中，死后都要被抄坟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>女性打工人，希望能安慰到打工的你！（bushi)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpD9JXzFGwUCXnNpXTp_3R9YLei_.m4a" length="32419401" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs9t2nTWPs0tV64bsi5wvIfP2PF4.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.45 过年吃的年货果子们，宝藏零食重在分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65db4fb5513a776b57b0388f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65db4fb5513a776b57b0388f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Feb 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好恰鬼系列第四弹：过年吃的年货果子们～</span></p><span></span><p><span>其他3颗“好恰弹”请跳转：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast-topic/65d35ce90847349e0c623cff" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast-topic/65d35ce90847349e0c623cff"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>这一期小朱和冰冰是在大年初六录制的，年味浓浓，好吃的零食也不能停。为了不熟悉江西零食的其他小伙伴，特地把图片都贴出来了。没错，年货果子们的包装还是万年不变，看看有没有你爱的菜～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> 豆角酥VS多味花生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 赣南人的过年“薯片”：月亮花生粑，附赠一首打油诗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="668">11:08</a> 曾是贡品的“江南小切”——丰城冻米糖，入口即化不是夸张词汇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> 小朱的年货兴奋点，果断得是辣条</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">24:25</a> 甘源食品，口味型坚果扛把子的，上市公司。令人上头的芥末味夏威夷果就出自他手，妥妥的江西本地品牌</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiq8NZGjo9QlCqC-0yUgLjoqGXpz.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>牡丹亭牌多味花生</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl8voXR63FnjMWbg2MEP3KObKvHO.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>鸽鸽辣条</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqPKZI08lko0rk-JId0oo-Rnykyt.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>吧吧佬佬</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuqeof1iDSbz7U77BObKGL4wWgMZ.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>子龙冻米糖（丰城特产）</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvHNDOXUWIz8mhwazcMwedmVB6up.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>月亮花生粑</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv_yY_FzLP8iDvygPMiFTKNhW9HE.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>甘源“老三样”</span></blockquote>]]></description>
